- \( \text{NiS} \): \( \text{Ksp} = 1.6 \times 10^{-10} \)

All the sulfides will precipitate because their \( \text{Ksp} \) values are close to the \( \text{Ksp} \) of \( \text{H}_2\text{S} \). 

