\]

Thus, the absolute value of the expression \( \left(\frac{1}{3}\sin t + \cos t\right) e^{-t/2} \) is bounded by:
\[
\left| \left(\frac{1}{3}\sin t + \cos t\right) e^{-t/2} \right| \leq \frac{4}{3} e^{-t/2}
