\]
Applying \( aD_t^p \) to \( g(t) \):
\[
aD_t^p g(t) = aD_t^p (aD_t^q f(t)) = \frac{a}{t^{p+1}} \int_a^t (t - t')^p g(t') \, dt'.
\]
