\[
aD_t^p (aD_t^q f(t)) = \frac{a}{t^{p+1}} \int_a^t (t - t')^p \left( \frac{a}{t'^{q+1}} \int_a^t (t' - t')^q f(t') \, dt' \right) \, dt'.
\]
Simplifying:
\[
