   - Since \( \angle ABC > \angle BCD \), the smallest angle in \( \triangle BCD \) is smaller than the smallest angle in \( \triangle ABC \).

7. **Final Conclusion:**
   - The inequality \( AC > BD \) holds because \( \angle ABC > \angle BCD \).

