   \[
   10 \text{ (remaining)} / 2 = 5 \text{ (pecan)} \quad \text{and} \quad 10 \text{ (remaining)} / 2 = 5 \text{ (lemon)}
   \]

3. **Calculate the angle for the lemon pie sector:**  
   \[
   \frac{5 \text{ (lemon)}} {40 \text{ (total)}} \times 360^\circ = 0.125 \times 360^\circ = 45^\circ
   \]

