   \frac{544}{Q_I} = 1 - 0.56 = 0.44
   \]
   \[
   Q_I = \frac{544}{0.44} \approx 1231 \, \text{kJ/kg}
   \]
   The total work done per kg is:
   \[
   W_T = \eta Q_I = 0.56 \times 1231 \approx 688.56 \, \text{kJ/kg}
