\]  
Substituting \( I \) into the deflection formula:  
\[
\delta_{\text{max}} = \frac{P L^3}{6 E \left(\frac{b t^3}{12}\right)} = \frac{P L^3}{6 \cdot \frac{b t^3}{12} \cdot E} = \frac{P L^3}{2 b t^3 E}
