   - \( Q = 10 \, \text{cm}^3 \, \text{min}^{-1} = 10 \times 10^{-6} \, \text{m}^3 \, \text{min}^{-1} \).
   - Convert to m³ s⁻¹: \( 10 \times 10^{-6} \, \text{m}^3 \, \text{min}^{-1} \times \frac{1 \, \text{min}}{60 \, \text{s}} = 1.67 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{m}^3 \, \text{s}^{-1} \).
